bin/
**/bin/
lich-cli/bin/
dist/
**/dist/
build/
**/build/
tmp/
**/tmp/
.air/

# Executables & Shared Libraries
*.exe
*.exe~
*.dll
*.so
*.dylib

# Test & Profiling outputs
*.test
*.out
*.prof
pprof.*
coverage.txt
coverage.html
coverage.out
profile.out
_test/
_testmain.go

# Go Workspaces & Vendor (uncomment if vendor is not committed)
go.work
go.work.sum
# vendor/
# **/vendor/

# Cgo generated files
*.cgo1.go
*.cgo2.c
_cgo_defun.c
_cgo_gotypes.go
_cgo_export.*

# Debugging binaries
__debug_bin*

